# Docker BuildKit picks this file up when building with `-f Dockerfile.data`.
# The data image only needs the auto-aero data, stages, and workflow directories; everything
# else in the repo is noise for this build. Docker cannot re-include a path whose
# parent directory is excluded, so re-include the chain one level at a time.
*
!source
source/*
!source/specializations
source/specializations/*
!source/specializations/auto-aero
source/specializations/auto-aero/*
!source/specializations/auto-aero/data
!source/specializations/auto-aero/stages
!source/specializations/auto-aero/workflow
